    "rationale": "The structural hardening, bounded AWS Windows and macOS JIT controllers, persistent one-shot Windows campaign admission ledger, agent-native Paper-to-Site propagation closure, exact Paper npm gitHead binding, exact-version pnpm release-age admission, generic finalized-package propagation capture, source-bound package release tags, locked consumer history selection, and documentation hardening may add responsibility-owned modules and exact evidence stages but must remain below these exact repository-wide ceilings. The allowance binds typed Work Control, advanced-channel-preserving durable recovery, npm and Git source coherence, public Passport readback, capture-only downstream handoff, production readback, exact-source cloud preflight, credential-safe JIT delivery, atomic cost reservation, permanent kill state, fail-closed cleanup, exact head and tree verification across ancestry-aware source gates, the authority-derived CLI and Node reference compiler, the clean-consumer Golden Path verifier, and regression guards instead of duplicated delivery behavior; any wider ceiling requires another reviewed policy change."
